✅ Recommended Structure (Simple & Clean)

You will create 3 SharePoint Lists:

1. 📂 Sections List

Stores your sections like PR INK PROC, PR PROC

Columns:

Title → Section Name
(e.g., PR INK PROC, PR PROC)



---

2. 🏭 Suppliers List

Stores supplier details

Columns:

Supplier Name (Single line text)
(LANXESS, FUSO, AOI, etc.)

Supplier Code (Number or text)
(341927, 334542)

Section (Lookup → Sections List)


👉 This links suppliers to a specific section


---

3. ❓ Questions List

Stores all questions per section

Columns:

Question No (e.g., M1R, M6R)

Description (e.g., Total Service)

Section (Lookup → Sections List)



---

4. 📝 Evaluation List (MAIN DATA)

This is where users will encode answers

Columns:

Section (Lookup → Sections)

Supplier (Lookup → Suppliers)

Question (Lookup → Questions)

Score (Choice: 1, 2, 3)



